{"id":"steam-2063201","steam":2063201,"igdb":null,"type":"dlc","title":"Hardcore Trivia Giant Quiz Package","summary":"Challenge your brains and have a fun time with Giant Quiz Package! It's time to test your knowledge! 8 themes: All-Stars ice-hockey, Caribbean Flags, The Roman Empire, European Flags, Solar System, Learn C++ Quiz Part1, General knowledge, U.S State Flags Trivia...","about":"This DLC includes 80 challenging questions and 8 categories:\r\n\r\n\n• Caribbean countries and territories Flag Quiz (10 questions)\r\n• All-Stars Ice-Hockey Quiz (10 questions)\r\n• Solar System Trivia (10 questions)\r\n• The Roman Empire Trivia (10 questions)\r\n• European countries and territories Quiz (10 questions)\r\n• Learn C++ Coding Trivia Part 1 (10 questions)\r\n• The 50 U.S. state Flags Trivia (10 questions)\r\n• General Knowledge Quiz (10 questions)\n\r\n\r\nCurrently these quizzes are part of the main game, but since the main game is getting bigger day by day, these 8 categories will be moved to this DLC-content and main game content will be changed.\r\n\r\nPLAY ON SOLO MODE OR WITH FRIENDS\r\n\r\nPlay solo mode or invite friends to play! You can also arrange event for your friends and you can compete together.\r\nEach question have 4 options, which only one is correct... Choose the correct one and you will be rewarded with a points! \r\nLearn while playing!","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063201/capsule_616x353.jpg?t=1698917759","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063201/header.jpg?t=1698917759","banner":null,"header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063201/header.jpg?t=1698917759","background":null,"screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063201/ss_5aaa15ca8c9c1cf339a7c938dbcb1a314c90a0cc.600x338.jpg?t=1698917759","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/